      },
      "mechanism": "Each unmatched ESC ] (or C1 OSC) starting position retries the lazy [\\s\\S]*? through the remaining suffix seeking BEL/ESC ST/C1 ST. With many starts and no terminator, log.replace scans successively overlapping suffixes. The incomplete-OSC guard runs only after that work. No new input-size bound exists in the changed function.",
